text.section:
Neither a public offering statement nor a resale certificate need be prepared or delivered in the case of:

A gratuitous disposition of a cooperative interest;


A disposition pursuant to court order;


A disposition by a government or governmental agency;


A disposition by foreclosure or transfer in lieu of foreclosure;


A disposition to a person in the business of selling cooperative interests who intends to offer those cooperative interests to purchasers; or


A disposition that may be canceled at any time and for any reason by the purchaser without penalty.
